  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 49a9dd75b14f64f43a98b9b523c7ac90, type: 3}
  m_Name: AndrewCubicle
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  _concurrentDialogue:
  - I was always worried about Andrew.
  - "He often arrived late and didn\u2019t complete his tasks."
  - While that should have made me upset, I could never get this one moment out of
    my head. The two of us collided once, dropping our papers everywhere. I caught
    a glimpse of his face while I was picking up my things.
  - Sheer fear.
  - His eyes were wide, mouth open, whole body frozen in time. He looked like he
    had never been more terrified in his life.
  - For his own sake, I almost hope he slept through the announcement, that he is
    blissfully unaware, and finally able to have one day of peace and tranquility.
  - 'I wonder if my eyes will look like that when the end comes tonight.  '
  _characterName: You
  _nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
